From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Maria Blasco <josep.maria.blasco@epbcn.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:46:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wasm: ADDRESS DOM, the page from classic Rexx (browser)

wasm/web/dom.cls, written in Rexx over cmdhandler.cls and js.cls (the page
realm): .CommandHandler~register("DOM", ...).  A root (the run option
dom: {root} of ooRexx.js, the page's body by default; NEW makes a floating
panel in a Shadow DOM and makes it the root; ROOT PAGE | ref), a current
element as in XEDIT (LOCATE, UP, TOP; CREATE, FIELD, BUTTON, TABLE and LIST
add without moving it), a label for a one-off target ('ref: CMD', a
nickname or a CSS selector).  Commands NEW, ROOT, LOCATE, UP, TOP, CLOSE,
CREATE, REMOVE, CLEAR, TEXT, VALUE, ATTR, STYLE, CLASS, SHOW, HIDE,
ENABLE, DISABLE, FOCUS, FIELD, BUTTON, TABLE, LIST, CSS, ON, OFF, WAIT.
Values FROM var and INTO var (a string, a .JSObject for an element, a
.DomEvent for WAIT); RC 0, positive + ERROR when the outcome is not the
expected one, negative + FAILURE when the program is wrong.  WAIT
dispatches .js~handler events while it waits for its own.  A built-in
stylesheet for the panels (light and dark).  ooRexx.js: option dom, as
the environment variable ORX_DOM_ROOT.  Preloaded in bin-web.  Test:
wasm/tests/dom.rex (64 checks) and three more cases in web-api.py.  Not
part of the posted RFE.
---
 wasm/build-web.sh       |    4 +-
 wasm/tests/dom.rex      |  238 +++++++++
 wasm/tests/web-api.html |    2 +-
 wasm/tests/web-api.py   |   11 +
 wasm/web/dom.cls        | 1032 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 wasm/web/ooRexx.js      |   14 +-
 6 files changed, 1298 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 wasm/tests/dom.rex
 create mode 100644 wasm/web/dom.cls

